title: The German October
subtitle: Moscow decides that the German revolution is at hand.
new-page: true
tags: rf_event
view-if: year = 1923 and month >= 9
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: line = "insurrection"

= The German October

Moscow has watched the Cuno strikes closely. The leaders of the Russian party have concluded that Germany is ready for a Communist rising, and the International has called the KPD's leaders to Moscow. Military advisers, money and plans will follow. The date is to be set for the autumn. Party organisers in Germany are told to prepare.

The KPD's own leaders are less sure. Brandler warns that the party is not yet ready and that the left SPD will not follow. The Left says the opposite.

[? if player_leads : As leader, your answer decides the party's course. ?][? if player_leads = 0 : The leadership will answer for the party. Your faction's stance will be remembered in Moscow. ?]

- @embrace: Throw everything into the preparations.
- @doubts: Accept, while warning Moscow that the party is not ready.
- @refuse: Refuse. The party is not ready, and a defeat will set it back years.

@embrace
on-arrival: {!
Q.october_plan = 1;
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] += 10;
Q.readiness += 6;
Q.funds += 2;
Q.autonomy -= 4;
!}

Military advisers arrive from Russia. The party's military apparatus draws up lists of weapons and targets. Moscow's money flows.

@doubts
on-arrival: {!
Q.october_plan = 1;
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] += 3;
Q.readiness += 4;
Q.funds += 2;
Q.autonomy -= 4;
!}

You accept the plan and put your doubts on record. If it fails, the record may help you, or may be used as proof that you never believed in it.

@refuse
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] -= 20;
Q.autonomy += 3;
Q.october_plan = 1;
if (Q.player_leads && Math.random() >= (100 - Q.autonomy) / 100) {
    Q.october_plan = 0;
}
!}

[? if october_plan = 0 : Against all expectations, the German leadership holds its ground. Moscow postpones the plan and makes clear it will not forget. ?][? if october_plan = 1 and player_leads : Moscow overrules you. The plan goes ahead, and you will be expected to lead it. ?][? if october_plan = 1 and player_leads = 0 : The leadership accepts Moscow's plan. Your objection is noted. ?]
